T` and `TRICOACH_APP_SECRET`\n  in the deploy environment.\n- Run one real Connect against Intervals.icu once the credentials are in place.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014zKn29qR9c6kkiCTVtRTBB","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
